  "contentHtml": "<p>#감열지&#160; #산성 #염기성 #고데기 #생활과학 #중화반응 #써모그래피<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fa5efa926a9e8f2029cad84cda4ef45fc6247db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fa5efa926a9e8f2029cad84cda4ef45fc6247db\" data-origin-width=\"875\" data-origin-height=\"702\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>감열지에는 발색제(류코염료)+현색제(주성분 페놀산-&quot;산성&quot;) 가 섞이지 않은 상태(마이크로캡슐)로 도포되어 있음.</p><p>열을 가하면, 마이크로 캡슐이 터지면서 현색제(페놀산이 주성분)가 녹아 산성 상태가 됨. 산성 상태에서 류코염료는 검은색, 혹은 파란색을 띰.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>관련영상 - 신과람</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/p_KHGs3Fj9k\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/p_KHGs3Fj9k</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p_KHGs3Fj9k\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"kakao_tv\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dWInRZ/hyNaxonClA/SkEAJOn5nwsPguhckd9SO0/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=258_111_345_206\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p_KHGs3Fj9k\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
